Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.41,0:00:12.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助的眼中再次浮现出神秘画面……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:17.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那是哥哥以前看过的景象
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.74,0:00:22.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,梦人已经策划了两起犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:27.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,借助神秘的左眼 爱之助试图与哥哥对抗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:32.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼侦探EYE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.18,0:01:02.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.81,0:01:11.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,房东先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.50,0:01:14.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,房东先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.65,0:01:18.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,房东先生？！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.41,0:01:20.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,房东先生？！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.65,0:01:25.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,みるく小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.31,0:01:29.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,みるく小姐！房东先生……みるく小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.63,0:01:55.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,みるく小姐……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.91,0:01:58.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:02.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.53,0:02:31.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你总是碍手碍脚 所以我决定让你闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.24,0:02:36.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是你杀了房东先生和みるく小姐吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.87,0:02:42.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没错 因为他们看到了我的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.78,0:02:50.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.72,0:02:53.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.57,0:03:07.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这全都是因为你多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.01,0:03:09.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好好看着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.39,0:03:21.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你太喜欢逞英雄了 现在你身边的人都要死
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.70,0:03:25.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,三……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:27.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这和老师没有关系！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:28.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,二……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.73,0:03:31.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果你想杀人 就冲我来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.97,0:03:33.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:51.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:58.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.41,0:04:03.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,杀人真的就这么简单 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:17.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:46.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么做了这么可怕的梦……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:50.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,3个月后 我会让你彻底变一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:52.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,三个月后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:55.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你也会变成能够杀人不眨眼的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:13.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么样 想好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:16.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要放我出去 再给我一把枪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.99,0:05:24.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们早就掌握犯人计划的全部细节了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:28.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这次会是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:34.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:43.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.19,0:05:44.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,音乐？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.27,0:05:48.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没错 音乐将成为凶器
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:06:05.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你应该也知道 福地警视是个优秀的刑警 办案从不徇私
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.08,0:06:08.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明白了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:11.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.09,0:06:12.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.45,0:06:16.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想请你们监视他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.85,0:06:19.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这不是爱之助吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.47,0:06:22.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想弄清他的真实底细
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:24.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不知为何 他总是能抢先知晓所有动向
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:27.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那是因为他的直觉很准吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.54,0:06:30.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这种解释可说服不了我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:37.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,去查查他是否和音乐有什么关联
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:38.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,和音乐？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.49,0:06:40.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,记得小心行事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:42.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:44.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.59,0:07:24.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“全部杀光”？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:26.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,报告！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.19,0:07:28.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 您还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.79,0:07:30.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:32.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我只是走神了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:38.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.06,0:07:52.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.15,0:07:54.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.11,0:07:58.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.84,0:08:00.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明明没有发出声音
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:01.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是超声波犬笛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:04.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,会发出高频振动 
人耳是听不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.43,0:08:06.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只有狗才能听见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.93,0:08:10.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这么说 你们很特别吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:12.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你没受伤吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:14.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没 我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:15.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.16,0:08:24.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个月要还1,200,000日元
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:28.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为了买结婚礼服 我的欠债又变多了……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.95,0:08:32.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太糟糕了 头发都分叉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:38.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来一想到债务 身体就越来越差……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:41.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,皮肤状态也糟透了……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.97,0:08:46.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早上用的刮毛刀也彻底不能用了……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.52,0:08:49.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我得买个新的……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:54.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不行！不行！不行！根本没钱！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.09,0:08:55.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:08:59.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请进！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:04.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗨！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.43,0:09:07.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是“YY金融”的谷田部
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.05,0:09:11.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个图表是什么意思？……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.51,0:09:20.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,实验用白鼠……还有摇滚乐队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.16,0:09:24.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这之间有什么联系？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.21,0:09:28.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,田中学长！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.14,0:09:29.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了 岛田？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:32.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你也是他们的粉丝吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.06,0:09:33.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,画上的是BLUE HEAVEN吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:35.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他们超酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.65,0:09:37.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,BLUE……HEAVEN？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:42.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦？你连自己画的是谁都不知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.16,0:09:45.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这支摇滚乐队现在非常火
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:51.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但在他们爆红的背后却藏着秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.26,0:09:57.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他们歌里唱的事情 在现实中真的发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.73,0:09:58.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.75,0:10:00.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请你快走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:02.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是被学校知道 我会被开除的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.39,0:10:03.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那可不行 拜托你快走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:08.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那可不行 我总不能空手回去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.93,0:10:16.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这可是我准备用上一周的生活费……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.81,0:10:20.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.05,0:10:22.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你当我是傻子吗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:25.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这一千日元算怎么回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:29.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你到底知不知道自己欠了多少钱？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:39.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭山老师 今天就先放过你 下次可没这么好糊弄了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:45.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“冻住吧！冻住吧！可怜的女孩！”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.15,0:10:47.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“凶手是谁？亲生母亲！”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:53.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“小狗 鸽子和海豹都将融入大海……”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:56.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是《冰冻地狱》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:11:00.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就像那个女学生被绑架并关在仓库里的案子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:04.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听说凶手是我们学校一个学生的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:08.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有一首 《削尖的骨头》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:16.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“把削尖的骨头刺进他体内！”
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.48,0:11:19.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“为父亲报仇的时刻到了！”
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.20,0:11:28.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,唱的是在婚礼上有人被刺杀的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.74,0:11:32.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,后来查明凶手是死刑犯的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:38.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可这些歌不是在案发之后才出的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.13,0:11:43.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是 BLUE HEAVEN 的专辑在案发前一个月就发行了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.55,0:11:44.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.21,0:11:47.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,两首歌里描写的事件都已经应验了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.47,0:11:50.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但还有第三首 里面唱的事情还没发生……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:53.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,《死亡演唱会》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:55.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大家都非常喜欢这首歌
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:59.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谁也不知道第三起事件什么时候会发生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.75,0:12:05.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他们在聊 BLUE HEAVEN
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:07.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,BLUE HEAVEN？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:13.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在中学生里很受欢迎的摇滚乐队
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:15.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 乐队？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.93,0:12:18.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视之前说的就是这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.53,0:12:21.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好厉害……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:24.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,走吧 学长！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.73,0:12:28.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这周六他们有演唱会 我有门票
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:33.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.65,0:12:35.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:37.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你打算穿什么衣服去？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:38.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.51,0:12:41.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要去看 BLUE HEAVEN 的演唱会 是有规矩的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:42.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,规矩？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:48.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好像必须穿带有蓝色的衣服才行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:50.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,带有蓝色？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.57,0:12:53.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哦 我正好有一件蓝色的外套！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:57.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.45,0:12:59.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.06,0:13:01.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:03.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这样真的能戒烟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:04.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把袖子卷起来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.91,0:13:06.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:10.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.32,0:13:11.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好痒！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:12.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.87,0:13:14.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:16.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,贴上戒烟贴片
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.62,0:13:19.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,房东先生决定戒烟了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:24.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,尼古丁会透过皮肤进入体内 这样就不会想抽烟了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.39,0:13:26.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这不是 BLUE HEAVEN 吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.45,0:13:28.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,来听听看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.26,0:13:32.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,放第三首 《死亡演唱会》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:35.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,《死亡演唱会》？好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.27,0:13:42.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“杀了他们！杀了他们！全杀光！”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.07,0:13:52.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太酷了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:53.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这都是些什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.88,0:13:56.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真是首糟糕的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:14:00.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,全杀光？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:07.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“杀了他们！杀了他们！全杀光！”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:09.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“杀了他们！杀了他们！全杀光！”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.30,0:14:11.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“看谁不爽就杀了他！”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.47,0:14:13.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们要不要去调查一下这支乐队？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.69,0:14:16.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们手上没有任何证据
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:18.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他们大可以说是巧合 那样我们也无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.37,0:14:21.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那潜入他们的演唱会看看如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.57,0:14:25.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好像正好就在这周六
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:36.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“全杀光”……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:40.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,到底会发生什么事呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.48,0:14:49.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经等不及了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:50.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哎呀 瞧瞧这是谁！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.55,0:14:53.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没想到会在这里遇到你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.84,0:14:55.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.55,0:14:57.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您怎么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.56,0:14:58.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭山老师？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.18,0:15:03.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你打算一个人调查吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.57,0:15:06.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好了 走吧？马上就要开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.96,0:15:08.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,走吧 走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:16.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,岛田 这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.67,0:15:18.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你不知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.74,0:15:20.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大家都会戴上这个来给乐队应援
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.77,0:15:23.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师你也戴上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:28.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 你不戴吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:31.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不太喜欢这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:34.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,戴了之后心情会变烦躁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:48.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生 你怎么也在这儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.61,0:15:49.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:51.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您怎么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,岛田 岛田！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:56.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嘘 我们正在执行潜入搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:58.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊对了 给你们介绍一下 这是我的新搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.71,0:16:00.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,向坂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:05.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为表现优异 被调到了我们课
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.02,0:16:06.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请允许我自我介绍一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:07.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是搜查课的向坂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.67,0:16:08.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.53,0:16:10.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.06,0:16:13.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不知道会发生什么事 所以请务必小心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.68,0:16:15.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,万一有什么事——我们就守在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.05,0:16:17.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.73,0:16:19.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那我们走吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:32.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:52.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你那个宝贝弟弟也来凑热闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.54,0:17:56.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让他死掉也没关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:59.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你玩得很开心嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.59,0:18:04.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实你真正想杀的不是他 而是我吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:06.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:08.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那未免太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:16.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要杀你 我也一定会亲自动手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.21,0:18:19.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你真是一点都没变
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.53,0:18:24.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那么 开始吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.49,0:18:35.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接下来请听 《死亡演唱会》！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.28,0:18:43.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“杀了他们！杀了他们！全杀光！”
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:48.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“杀了他们！杀了他们！全杀光！”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.26,0:19:03.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好热！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:06.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好难受……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.30,0:19:07.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.61,0:19:09.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你怎么了？怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:12.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不知怎么搞的 我突然烦躁得要命……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.20,0:19:16.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不行了……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.11,0:19:21.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我现在好想揍你一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:22.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.81,0:19:24.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看不见了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:26.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 你干什么？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.23,0:19:28.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好难受……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.56,0:19:31.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真想随便找个人揍一顿！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.09,0:19:37.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“杀了他们！杀了他们！全杀光！”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.56,0:19:42.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“杀了他们！杀了他们！全杀光！”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:52.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哎呀呀 虽然不知道怎么回事 但这里好像混进了一个没穿蓝色的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.35,0:19:56.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？在哪儿？指给我看！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:19:59.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 那个没穿蓝色的蠢货在哪儿？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.35,0:20:02.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不就在那儿嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.35,0:20:13.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,居然敢不穿蓝色就跑来参加BLUE HEAVEN的演唱会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:17.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你到底来干什么的？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.71,0:20:20.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我本来戴了蓝色的帽子 可是弄丢了……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.21,0:20:22.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,臭小子 少在这儿撒谎！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.01,0:20:25.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打死他！打死他！打死他！打死他！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.98,0:20:31.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打死他！打死他！打死他！打死他！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.32,0:20:32.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,岛田？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.09,0:20:38.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？爱之助？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.30,0:20:58.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了？出什么事了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.39,0:21:00.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:12.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他没撒谎！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:13.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.59,0:21:25.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都给我让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.41,0:21:33.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.26,0:21:35.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.06,0:21:42.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,5
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.25,0:21:43.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,4
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.10,0:21:44.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:45.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.32,0:21:46.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,1
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.21,0:21:54.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让开！都散开！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.02,0:22:09.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.88,0:22:11.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:20.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,岛田呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.62,0:22:24.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他在重症监护室……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.84,0:22:28.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,到现在还没恢复意识
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.92,0:22:35.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,身上多处骨折 还有脑震荡 医生说情况很危急
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.49,0:22:37.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会变成这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.49,0:22:45.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我只记得不知为什么 突然变得异常烦躁……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.32,0:22:53.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大家不知怎么的全都变得奇奇怪怪的……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.06,0:23:06.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多亏向坂反应快 把电闸切断了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.19,0:23:13.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,靠他的机智才把你们救了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:21.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个时候 哥哥在倒数
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.12,0:23:24.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.42,0:23:28.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 抱歉 我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.56,0:23:33.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉不能陪着你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.47,0:23:36.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:42.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是 如果哥哥的目的就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.87,0:23:44.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么又要阻止那场斗殴？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.55,0:23:53.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我左眼看到的“杀光所有人”到底是什么意思……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.53,0:23:57.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道还会发生什么事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.57,0:24:07.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 狭山老师 我一直在等您的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.42,0:24:12.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好意思没能早点打给您 刚才出了点事……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.47,0:24:16.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,关于还钱的事……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.97,0:24:19.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能不能请您再宽限几天？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.38,0:24:44.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,岛田
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.26,0:24:49.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会替你报仇……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:01.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,演唱会上的骚乱
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.99,0:25:07.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,仅凭岛田出的意外 还不能断定这个乐队与之前的案件有关
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.05,0:25:11.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视 不如允许他们再办一场演唱会如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.91,0:25:13.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还是不要了 向坂
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.61,0:25:17.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,万一骚乱再次发生 又有人受伤怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.96,0:25:20.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不能冒这个险
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.23,0:25:22.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.05,0:25:25.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让他们再办一场演唱会
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.17,0:25:26.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.79,0:25:39.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,豚太 圭介 等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.59,0:25:45.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来它们很喜欢你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.69,0:25:47.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.37,0:25:52.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你身上的伤是怎么弄的？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.03,0:25:55.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,上次去看BLUE HEAVEN演唱会弄伤的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.71,0:25:59.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,下次我还要去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.84,0:26:01.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.78,0:26:07.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别去了 太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.33,0:26:08.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.76,0:26:11.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.63,0:26:13.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.78,0:26:15.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我太喜欢他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.96,0:26:17.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那我先走啦 回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.19,0:26:18.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.81,0:26:24.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.00,0:26:25.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.26,0:26:29.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,出了一次意外还不够吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.97,0:26:34.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,悄悄告诉你 我们是想再看看会发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.98,0:26:39.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是这次闹出人命 你们怎么负责？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.52,0:26:42.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生 要开会了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.11,0:26:44.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉 回头再聊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.60,0:27:07.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,《冰封地狱》和《尖锐骨头》的歌词显然与已发生的案件一致
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.72,0:27:09.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.41,0:27:14.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,极有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.25,0:27:18.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,BLUE HEAVEN与罪犯之间存在某种联系
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.07,0:27:23.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在他们上一场演唱会上 有两名中学生遭到了围殴
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.48,0:27:27.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其中一人至今昏迷不醒
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.60,0:27:30.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他们的演唱会很可能有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.67,0:27:34.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但具体动了什么手脚 目前尚不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.10,0:27:37.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,下一场演唱会可能还会出事
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.45,0:27:39.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大家都提高警惕
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.06,0:27:41.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.98,0:27:47.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么大家会突然变得那么烦躁？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.39,0:27:50.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道是有什么气体？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.01,0:27:54.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但如果是气体 老师也应该会受影响才对
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.16,0:27:59.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可当时起反应的只有我 老师却没有
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.64,0:28:02.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道是只有年轻人才会起反应的东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.12,0:28:06.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,比如什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.62,0:28:09.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,光？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.94,0:28:11.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,声音？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.89,0:28:13.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,声音？！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.31,0:28:15.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是超声波犬笛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.01,0:28:20.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,会发出高频振动 
人耳是听不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.18,0:28:21.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.54,0:28:26.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要把频率调高 就只有年轻人能听见
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.11,0:28:29.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就像蚊音那样
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.53,0:28:43.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,利用这种频率的声音 就能让人变得焦躁发狂
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.51,0:28:47.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥完全做得出这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.97,0:28:49.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.94,0:28:55.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要在演唱会上找到并破坏播放这种声音的音响就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.81,0:29:03.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.59,0:29:06.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 爱之助？我想我明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.89,0:29:09.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大家为什么会打起来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.91,0:29:10.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是因为……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.85,0:29:11.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,……声音吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.42,0:29:13.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.05,0:29:16.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.11,0:29:21.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的吗？我还以为自己是个天才呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.06,0:29:23.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,演唱会本来就很吵
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.06,0:29:28.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算混进别的声音也不会有人察觉
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.44,0:29:31.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一定是放了类似蚊音的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.60,0:29:34.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,果然是蚊音啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.49,0:29:36.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等一下……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.81,0:29:39.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那我为什么听不见？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.58,0:29:42.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,说明老师你已经上了年纪了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.47,0:29:44.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.24,0:29:48.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.19,0:29:53.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,BLUE HEAVEN马上又要开演唱会了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.46,0:29:58.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我打算去阻止他们
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.74,0:29:59.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.75,0:30:11.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们怎么又来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.99,0:30:13.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.71,0:30:16.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,向坂先生呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.91,0:30:18.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,已经在里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.71,0:30:21.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天潜伏了很多便衣警察
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.94,0:30:25.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但不知道会发生什么 你们千万要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.90,0:30:36.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.31,0:30:38.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.61,0:31:11.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,得找到播放蚊音的音响
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.59,0:31:15.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定要阻止哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.62,0:31:24.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.27,0:31:25.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.79,0:31:27.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.79,0:31:32.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,马上就是最后一首歌了 把强度调大
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.24,0:31:35.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪怕要杀了你弟弟也没关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.84,0:31:37.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.84,0:31:42.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们需要获取最后这项实验的数据
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.16,0:31:48.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“杀了他们！杀了他们！全杀光！”
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.30,0:31:53.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“杀了他们！杀了他们！全杀光！”
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.92,0:32:09.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 动手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.30,0:32:10.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.13,0:32:17.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,音箱……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.28,0:32:21.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,发出听不见声音的音箱……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.84,0:32:23.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也一定能找到
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.92,0:32:26.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,找到并砸碎它！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.26,0:32:29.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“杀了他们！杀了他们！全杀光！”
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.49,0:32:53.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再不快点的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.12,0:32:56.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又变热了……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.35,0:32:58.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.78,0:33:00.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 不妙 
- 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.93,0:33:02.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我又开始烦躁起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.46,0:33:03.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又来了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.28,0:33:08.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可恶 好烦躁……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.26,0:33:12.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 我想揍人……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.46,0:33:14.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别说傻话
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.41,0:33:26.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦？跟年龄没关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.25,0:33:31.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就不是蚊音了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.50,0:33:34.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我才不老呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.27,0:33:42.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 打我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.12,0:33:45.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是……我没那么火大啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.68,0:33:47.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快打我！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.94,0:34:02.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,温度？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.09,0:34:14.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道说……？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.29,0:34:21.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,贴上戒烟贴片
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.50,0:34:24.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,尼古丁会通过皮肤进入体内……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.94,0:34:32.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,温度升高会加速药效吸收
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.69,0:34:43.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 是温度！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.95,0:34:44.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,温度？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.19,0:34:51.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来这里有个没穿蓝色衣服的家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.23,0:34:54.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是谁？宰了他！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.52,0:34:57.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在那边！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.03,0:34:58.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,杀了她！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.00,0:35:05.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,杀了她！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.52,0:35:08.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们想干什么？！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.02,0:35:16.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把温度降下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.36,0:35:19.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,知道了 我马上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.06,0:35:21.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.09,0:35:24.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,杀了她！杀了她！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.96,0:35:29.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不要啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.80,0:35:47.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.39,0:35:51.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯……才到80%
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.15,0:35:57.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤 出什么事了？加藤？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.09,0:35:59.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤？！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.96,0:36:03.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,门全都打不开 怎么降温啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.26,0:36:08.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这边……还是这边……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.81,0:36:17.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,闪开！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.14,0:36:23.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快把手环摘下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.94,0:36:26.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凭什么听你的？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.88,0:36:29.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,杀了他！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.96,0:36:31.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你算哪根葱啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.55,0:36:56.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他那么信任我 我却什么都做不了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.25,0:37:01.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,90%了……还差一点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.04,0:37:22.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,越叫我别碰 我越想碰！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.99,0:37:23.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,给我放开！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.75,0:37:25.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.27,0:37:50.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.49,0:38:25.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所有人快把手环摘下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.93,0:38:47.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢你救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.48,0:38:49.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太好了 你没事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.59,0:38:56.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你弟弟又把事情搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.77,0:39:04.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 爱之助 成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.35,0:39:05.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.20,0:39:07.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多亏了老师 谢谢你救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.32,0:39:16.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.28,0:39:18.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我马上来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.96,0:39:25.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是吗？知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.68,0:39:28.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那我们回警署了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.26,0:39:29.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,向坂 收队
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.10,0:39:31.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.89,0:39:42.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这么说 又是田中爱之助破了案……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.34,0:39:52.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个女人不像普通的保健老师
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.70,0:40:03.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,岛田
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.12,0:40:04.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,学长
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.63,0:40:05.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭山老师
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.93,0:40:09.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太好了 你终于醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.12,0:40:15.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,学长 是你救了我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.81,0:40:17.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.72,0:40:20.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你没事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.45,0:40:22.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.18,0:40:29.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这三首歌绝对会大卖
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.99,0:40:36.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们就唱这几首出专辑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.64,0:40:40.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,感谢的话以后再说
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.47,0:40:41.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.87,0:40:46.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说 你们歌词里写到的罪行
接二连三地变成了现实
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.65,0:40:47.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.35,0:40:54.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,顺便问一下 这个是在你们化妆间找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.96,0:40:56.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,里面装的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.01,0:40:59.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,完全不知道 不是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.35,0:41:11.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个女人……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.36,0:41:27.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,岛田恢复意识了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.00,0:41:32.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这一次 我成功阻止了……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.53,0:41:36.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼看到的“全杀光”的惨剧……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.14,0:41:40.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.31,0:42:10.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,みるく小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.98,0:42:13.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你那还有戒烟贴片吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.75,0:42:17.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,贴太多可不好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.40,0:42:19.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,来 吃个苹果吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.98,0:42:27.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 有位刑警来找你 正在你房间等着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.65,0:42:29.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他叫向坂
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.52,0:42:35.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.78,0:42:49.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天的演唱会很精彩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.81,0:42:55.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你打了多少人？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.59,0:43:03.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打人的感觉很痛快吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.01,0:43:20.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这些手环在黑市上能卖个好价钱
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.02,0:43:22.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,实验很成功
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.23,0:43:31.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绑架案还有婚礼上的杀人案……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.38,0:43:35.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都是为了给BLUE HEAVEN的歌造势而策划的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.42,0:43:40.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你杀人只是为了让案件
吻合歌词的内容吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.46,0:43:44.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.13,0:43:52.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你到底有什么目的？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.32,0:43:58.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么要伤害无辜的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.42,0:44:06.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没办法 为了我的伟大目标 牺牲是难免的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.03,0:44:17.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我现在真的很想杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.08,0:44:21.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就动手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.76,0:44:25.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们学校那个保健老师叫什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.84,0:44:29.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭山瞳？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.65,0:44:40.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不行 那样杀不了我……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.30,0:44:45.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要对准这里 这里
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.82,0:44:49.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,来啊！怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.42,0:44:54.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,动手啊！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.21,0:45:07.98,SongTop,,0,0,0,,即使眼中映出的世界满是悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.20,0:45:14.57,SongTop,,0,0,0,,我们的青春物语也绝不再逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.66,0:45:22.56,SongTop,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 一定能寻找到光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.66,0:45:30.49,SongTop,,0,0,0,,因为想看到泪水过后的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.59,0:45:37.29,SongTop,,0,0,0,,就算对未来感到不安 也不要敷衍逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.54,0:45:43.82,SongTop,,0,0,0,,不要对自己说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.11,0:45:51.28,SongTop,,0,0,0,,纵然迷茫 迷茫 再迷茫 依然怀揣梦想 追逐梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.44,0:45:58.15,SongTop,,0,0,0,,坚信这份心意终能传达 直到实现
